{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27973","headline":"酬萧员外见寄 · 朱庆余","name":"酬萧员外见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麦风吹雨正徘徊，忽报书从郡合来。\n道薄谬应宗伯选，诗成徒费谢公才。\n九霄示路空知感，十上惊魂尚未回。\n胜寄幸容溪馆宿，龙锺慙见妓筵开。\n傥期霁後陪新兴，一滴还须当一桮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}